//RS //! Typed bridge from the resident devtools session to the native overlay host.
//RS //!
//RS //! The session is the only source of canonical events.  This adapter keeps
//RS //! their typed identity and body intact, projects them into an explicit Event
//RS //! Log panel, and carries separately supplied typed panels through unchanged.
//RS //! It never parses `devtools_json`, chooses a panel policy, or executes an action.
//RS 
//RS use std::collections::{BTreeMap, BTreeSet, VecDeque};
//RS 
